<title>UK: Algeria buys 150,000 tonnes Canadian wheat.</title>
<headline>Algeria buys 150,000 tonnes Canadian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has bought 150,000 tonnes of Canadian wheat for shipment in July and August, European grain exporters said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Pricing details were not immediately available, but one exporter pegged the price at around $165 per tonne on a cost and freight basis. - - London Newsdesk +44 171 542 7729</p>
</text>
